TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-q-alg-9707006v1
AU  - Chryssomalakos∗, Chryssomalis
TI  - Drinfeld twist for quantum su(2) in the adjoint representation
DA  - D:20210521
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/q-alg/9707006
AB  - We give a detailed description of the adjoint representation of Drinfeld’s twist element, as well as of its coproduct, for suq(2). We also discuss, as applications, the computation of the universal R-matrix in this representation and the problem of symmetrization of identical-particle states with quantum su(2) symmetry. ∗e-mail address: chryss@stp.dias.ie
ER  - 
